---
import Public from '../layouts/Public.astro';

const roles = [
  { tag: 'v0.1', title: 'Prácticas (FCT)', badge: 'Foundations', where: 'Grupo Tramontia, at the CAU of a client', body: 'Your first badge, a desk at the client, a laptop that isn\'t yours.', done: true },
  { tag: 'v1.0', title: 'First contract', badge: 'Support L1', where: 'Grupo Tramontia, same client, Hortalia', body: 'N1 at the CAU: Javi\'s printer, Elena at month end, tickets in English and in Spanish.', done: true },
  { tag: 'v1.4', title: 'A year later', badge: 'Systems L2', where: 'Grupo Tramontia, the client\'s operations team', body: 'Your first on-call, change requests with a rollback, and learning to say no politely.', done: true },
  { tag: 'v2.0-rc', title: 'The jump', badge: 'between roles', where: 'CV, a technical interview, an offer', body: 'Rotation is high and the salary has a ceiling. Carmen moved last year; she refers you.', done: false },
  { tag: 'v2.0', title: 'Second job', badge: 'Junior DevOps', where: 'Tidewell, the platform team', body: 'You own what you deploy, write postmortems, and the Friday deploy is still \'forbidden\'.', done: true },
];
const branches = [
  { path: 'Security', title: 'SOC L1 at Sereno, a managed security provider', body: 'Rotating shifts, alerts at 3 a.m., most of them nothing. Samuel: "show me the log".' },
  { path: 'Backend', title: 'A Grupo Tramontia project for a client, then product', body: 'Often a public-sector project you didn\'t choose. Andrés, later: "boring is good".' },
];
const people = [
  { name: 'Carmen Ortega', src: '/cast/carmen.png', body: 'Your senior at the consultora, now at Tidewell. Answers with a question; the AI hints speak as her.' },
  { name: 'Nora Vidal', src: '/cast/nora.png', body: 'From FP too, a role ahead. Shares her "things I broke" file. She jumps before you.' },
  { name: 'Pablo Herrera', src: '/cast/pablo.png', body: 'Started with you. Says "Done!" before it is done. He stays at the consultora, and that\'s a path too.' },
  { name: 'Javi Sanz', src: '/cast/javi.png', body: 'Marketing at the client. His printer is behind half the tickets.' },
  { name: 'Elena Ruiz', src: '', body: 'Finance at the client. Polite, precise, impatient at month end.' },
  { name: 'Lucía Navarro', src: '/cast/lucia.png', body: 'Head of Platform at Tidewell. Interviews you at the jump.' },
];
const real = [
  'Most junior IT jobs in Spain start at a helpdesk (CAU), often through a consultora',
  'The jump to a second job takes one to three years of experience',
  'Salaries come from real postings, shown as data, never as a promise',
  'Rotation, salary ceilings and projects you didn\'t pick are part of it too',
];
const card = 'flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-6';
const label = 'm-0 text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.8px] text-muted uppercase';
const btn = 'inline-flex h-11 items-center justify-center rounded-[10px] px-[18px] text-[15px] font-bold no-underline';
---

<Public
  title="The story: your first years in IT"
  description="A real Spanish junior career, from prácticas at a consultora to a second job. You work in English; the companies around you are Spanish."
>
  <main class="relative mx-auto flex max-w-[1200px] flex-col gap-[18px] px-4 pt-5 pb-24 md:gap-6 md:px-6 md:pt-9 md:pb-12">
    <section class="flex flex-col items-start gap-4 text-left md:items-center md:text-center">
      <h1 class="m-0 text-[34px] leading-[1.06] font-extrabold tracking-[-1.5px] md:text-[56px]">
        Your first years in IT, <span class="hl">as they really go</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="m-0 text-[15px] leading-[1.55] text-fg2 md:text-[17px]">The story follows a real Spanish junior career: prácticas at a consultora, a helpdesk at a client, on-call, the jump to a second job. You work in English; the companies around you are Spanish.</p>
    </section>

    <section class={card} aria-labelledby="timeline">
      <h2 id="timeline" class={label}>git tag --list · the Systems and DevOps path</h2>
      <ol class="m-0 flex list-none flex-col p-0">
        {roles.map((r, i) => (
          <li class="flex items-stretch gap-3 md:gap-[18px]">
            <div class="flex w-4 flex-none flex-col items-center">
              <span class={`mt-1 size-3.5 flex-none rounded-full ${r.done ? 'bg-accent' : 'box-border border-2 border-accent bg-surface'}`} aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span class="sr-only">{r.done ? "Done" : "Not yet"}</span>
              {i < roles.length - 1 && <span class="w-0.5 flex-1 bg-line" aria-hidden="true"></span>}
            </div>
            <div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-1.5 pb-[18px] md:pb-[22px]">
              <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5">
                <span class="rounded-md bg-accentsoft px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[13px] font-bold text-accentink">{r.tag}</span>
                <h3 class="m-0 text-[17px] font-extrabold">{r.title}</h3>
                <span class={`inline-flex h-[26px] flex-none items-center rounded-md px-2.5 text-xs font-bold whitespace-nowrap ${r.done ? 'bg-accentsoft text-accentink' : 'bg-surface2 text-fg2'}`}>{r.badge}</span>
              </div>
              <span class="font-mono text-xs text-muted">{r.where}</span>
              <p class="m-0 text-sm leading-[1.55] text-fg2">{r.body}</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ol>
      <p class="m-0 text-[13px] leading-[1.55] text-muted">Each role takes you weeks in the Dojo; in the story, months or years go by.</p>
    </section>

    <section class={card} aria-labelledby="branches">
      <h2 id="branches" class={label}>Other paths branch off on the way</h2>
      <ul class="m-0 grid list-none grid-cols-1 gap-3.5 p-0 md:grid-cols-2">
        {branches.map((b) => (
          <li class="flex flex-col gap-1.5 rounded-xl border border-line p-4">
            <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-accentink">{b.path}</span>
            <h3 class="m-0 text-[15px] font-extrabold">{b.title}</h3>
            <p class="m-0 text-sm leading-[1.55] text-fg2">{b.body}</p>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class={card} aria-labelledby="people">
      <h2 id="people" class={label}>The people</h2>
      <ul class="m-0 grid list-none grid-cols-1 gap-[18px] p-0 md:grid-cols-2">
        {people.map((p) => (
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            {p.name === 'Carmen Ortega' ? (
              <img src={p.src} alt="" width="48" height="48" class="block size-12 flex-none" />
            ) : p.src ? (
              <span class="relative inline-block size-10 flex-none overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-accentsoft">
                <img src={p.src} alt="" width="44" height="44" class="absolute -bottom-0.5 -left-0.5 size-11 max-w-none" />
              </span>
            ) : (
              <span class="inline-flex size-10 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accentsoft font-extrabold text-accentink" aria-hidden="true">E</span>
            )}
            <div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-0.5">
              <h3 class="m-0 text-[15px] font-extrabold">{p.name}</h3>
              <p class="m-0 text-sm leading-[1.55] text-fg2">{p.body}</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </section>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 items-start gap-[18px] md:grid-cols-[1.2fr_1fr] md:gap-5">
      <section class={card} aria-labelledby="moment">
        <h2 id="moment" class={label}>A story moment · v2.0-rc, the jump</h2>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
          <span class="relative inline-block size-9 flex-none overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-accentsoft">
            <img src="/cast/lucia.png" alt="" width="40" height="40" class="absolute -bottom-0.5 -left-0.5 size-10 max-w-none" />
          </span>
          <p class="m-0 text-[15px] leading-[1.55]"><b>Lucía</b> · Carmen says you know your way around an incident. Walk me through the worst one you've had.</p>
        </div>
        <ul class="m-0 flex list-none flex-col gap-3 p-0">
          {['Tell it as a postmortem: what happened, what you did, what you changed after', 'Say it was the network and move on'].map((c) => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm leading-[1.45]">
              <span class="inline-flex size-5 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-muted"><span class="sr-only">Not yet</span></span>
              <span>{c}</span>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
        <p class="m-0 text-[13px] leading-[1.55] text-muted">Your old ticket replies and postmortems are your answer. The track record is how you prove it.</p>
      </section>

      <section class={card} aria-labelledby="real">
        <h2 id="real" class={label}>Real, on purpose</h2>
        <ul class="m-0 flex list-none flex-col gap-3 p-0">
          {real.map((t) => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm leading-[1.45]">
              <span class="inline-flex size-5 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-ok text-xs font-extrabold text-white"><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span class="sr-only">Done</span></span>
              <span>{t}</span>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </section>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:justify-center">
      <a href="/paths" class={`${btn} bg-accent text-accentfg`}>Pick your path</a>
    </div>
  </main>
</Public>
